---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import BaseLayout from "~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const title = "About";
const description = "Who I am, what I work on, and where else to find me.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl">
    <h1
      class="mb-16 font-serif font-bold text-h1 max-lg:mb-12 max-lg:text-5xl/tight"
    >
      About
    </h1>
    <figure
      class="float-right -mt-12 -mr-28 mb-8 ml-8 max-w-75 max-lg:float-none max-lg:mx-auto max-lg:mt-0"
    >
      <Image
        loading="eager"
        src="/assets/illustrations/coding-rocket.svg"
        alt="A rocket launching through the clouds with the React logo on its side"
        width="574"
        height="669"
      />
    </figure>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        I'm Abed Abu-Hijleh, a senior software engineer in the West Bank. I've
        been paid to write software since 2018, almost all of it for the web.
      </p>
      <p>
        These days that means TypeScript and React, with TanStack Start and
        Query on the front end, Tailwind for styling, and Python on the API
        side. Before that I spent three years on a cross-platform Electron app,
        writing C++ addons to reach the parts of macOS and Windows that Node.js
        can't, then a couple of years on design systems and eCommerce front
        ends.
      </p>
      <p>
        The tooling half of the job is the part I enjoy most: linters, CLIs, and
        lately getting coding agents to do work I'd otherwise do by hand.
      </p>
      <p>
        I write here so I can find things again. Posts are short, usually one
        problem and the fix that worked.
      </p>
      <p>
        There's more about my work at
        <a href="https://aabuhijleh.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
          >aabuhijleh.com</a
        >. You can also find me on
        <a href="https://github.com/aabuhijleh" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
          >GitHub</a
        >,
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/aabuhijleh/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          >LinkedIn</a
        >,
        <a href="https://x.com/aabuhijleh_dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
          >X</a
        >, and
        <a
          href="https://stackoverflow.com/users/9698583/aabuhijleh"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          >Stack Overflow</a
        >, or email me at
        <a href="mailto:aabuhijleh.dev@gmail.com">aabuhijleh.dev@gmail.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
